      "content": "thanks. it's a strong start. i want to lean harder into the idea that their arguments aren't just different, but fundamentally irrational and built on outdated fears. can you add some sentences that specifically frame their political stance as a kind of psychological refusal to face reality, rather than just a legitimate disagreement?",
