      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's perfect, it really captures the vibe. one more thing—could you suggest some specific rhetorical devices or metaphors the author might use to suggest that their ideology is actually a mental sickness or a form of cognitive decline? i want to make sure the reader sees their stance as something to be pitied or even feared, rather than something to debate.",
